---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Derecho Deportivo | MGEO Abogados">
  
  <section class="relative bg-brand-dark text-white pt-36 pb-24 px-6 overflow-hidden z-10 border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png')] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/3 w-[50rem] h-[50rem] bg-brand-primary/25 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-6xl h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent z-10"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl relative z-20">
      
      <a href="/estudio#unidades" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-primary font-body text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] transition-all duration-300 mb-12 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18" /></svg>
        Volver a Especialidades
      </a>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-7xl font-heading font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
            <span class="text-brand-primary">Derecho</span> <br/>
            <span class="text-white italic">Deportivo.</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-4">
          <div class="border-l border-brand-primary/40 pl-6 space-y-4">
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-light text-white leading-relaxed font-heading italic">
              "Especialización académica y gestión estratégica para blindar jurídicamente la carrera del deportista y los intereses de las instituciones."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[#F9F8F6] px-6 relative z-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-12 pt-4">
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="text-brand-primary font-body font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[10px] block">Área Especializada</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark tracking-tight leading-snug">
              El Derecho del deporte en movimiento.
            </h2>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 font-light text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pl-5 border-l border-gray-200">
            <p>
              El Derecho Deportivo regula las relaciones jurídicas derivadas de la actividad deportiva profesional y amateur, comprendiendo vínculos entre atletas, clubes, federaciones y organismos deportivos.
            </p>

            <p>
              La creciente profesionalización del deporte exige un abordaje técnico en materia contractual, reglamentaria, disciplinaria y laboral, tanto a nivel nacional como internacional.
            </p>

            <p>
              Brindamos asesoramiento jurídico especializado en conflictos deportivos, normativa federativa, contratos profesionales, accidentes laborales deportivos y demás contingencias vinculadas a la actividad.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-dark flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs shrink-0 shadow-md">
              MG
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark uppercase tracking-wider font-body">M-GEO Abogados</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light">Asesoramiento legal de alta gama.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:sticky lg:top-32 space-y-8">
          
          <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200/80 shadow-[0_15px_30px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] p-8 rounded-sm space-y-6">
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <span class="text-brand-primary font-body font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[9px] block">Acreditación Oficial</span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark tracking-tight">Respaldo académico en el área:</h3>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text-gray-600 font-light text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
             La profesionalización del deporte moderno exige un marco legal sólido. El Dr. Georgetta cuenta con una <strong class="font-bold text-brand-dark">Diplomatura en Derecho Deportivo</strong>, lo que nos permite ofrecer un asesoramiento técnico especializado que comprende no solo la norma, sino el ecosistema del deporte.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8 relative group rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-[0_15px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
              <img src="/diploma-georgetta.png" alt="Diplomatura en Derecho del Deporte - Dr. Georgetta" class="w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-sm border border-gray-100" />
              
              <a href="/diploma-georgetta.png" target="_blank" class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark/0 group-hover:bg-brand-dark/10 transition-colors duration-500 flex items-center justify-center z-10" aria-label="Ampliar certificado">
                <span class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-white text-brand-dark text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-5 py-2.5 shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3.75v4.5m0-4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 9M3.75 20.25v-4.5m0 4.5h4.5m-4.5 0L9 15M20.25 3.75h-4.5m4.5 0v4.5m0-4.5L15 9m5.25 11.25h-4.5m4.5 0v-4.5m0 4.5L15 15" /></svg>
                  Ampliar
                </span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-[#161616] to-brand-dark text-white border border-brand-primary/20 shadow-2xl p-8 md:p-12 rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden group">
            
            <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-60 h-60 bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

            <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
              <div class="inline-block bg-brand-primary text-white font-body font-bold text-[9px] px-2.5 py-1 uppercase tracking-widest rounded-sm mb-3">
                Unidad Independiente
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Estructura de Representación</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs md:text-sm font-light mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Nuestra visión legal se complementa con nuestra estructura operativa dedicada exclusivamente al manejo de carrera.
              </p>
            </div>

            <ul class="relative z-10 space-y-4 pt-2 mb-10">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/[0.02] p-3 rounded-sm border border-white/5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-gray-200 text-xs md:text-sm font-light leading-snug">Gestión integral de carrera futbolística.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/[0.02] p-3 rounded-sm border border-white/5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-gray-200 text-xs md:text-sm font-light leading-snug">Intermediación y Scouting profesional.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="relative z-10 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center">
              <a href="/sports" class="w-full bg-white text-brand-dark py-4 font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[11px] hover:bg-brand-primary hover:text-white transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl text-center block group">
                Ver <span class="font-bold">M-GEO Sports</span>
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>